# Project state

Copy this to `STATE.md` when you start. It is gitignored: it describes one
product rather than the starter, and `SessionStart` reads it back so the thread
survives a context window closing.

```
Product:     <name>
Started:     <date>
Phase:       discover | prototype | build | ship | closed

Riskiest assumption:
  <one sentence, or UNWRITTEN — discovery does not end until this is filled in>

Feature list (cut to what the time allows):
  - [ ] …

Slices landed:
  - …

Cut, and why:
  - …

Open questions:
  - …
```
